  "inputBoundary": "One caller-supplied finite frequency parameter in epochs per day. The study defines an epoch as screen-on through the successive screen-off and the frequency parameter as mean daily epoch count for one month; raw event pairing, day boundaries, exposure completeness, and mean derivation remain upstream.",
  "outputBoundary": "Classify criterionapp A7 excessive use only when the frequency parameter is strictly greater than 68.4 epochs per day; equality and lower values are not excessive.",
  "limitations": [
    "This binding implements only the canonical criterionapp A7 frequency threshold and does not implement psychiatric diagnosis, interview adjudication, or other addiction criteria.",
    "The threshold is reported as inherited from reference 12; this fixture preserves that provenance without claiming to execute the referenced study.",
    "The table labels daily use frequency with '(F-trend)' while the methods prose calls the thresholded value the frequency parameter; this binding follows the canonical audited frequency atom and does not collapse that terminology into the separate trend computation.",
